{"seq":2,"slug":"file-drop-upload","title":"文件拖放与上传","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-clipboard-dragdrop/dragdrop/file-drop-upload","wordCount":1049,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"文件拖放与上传\">文件拖放与上传</h1><p>「把文件拖进这个框就能上传」是原生 HTML5 拖放协议最有价值、也最经得起时间考验的用途。它安全（全程显式手势、数据仅在 drop 时刻可读）、直观、且能一次拖入几十个文件甚至整个目录。但要把它做扎实，得跨过几道坎：从 <code>dataTransfer</code> 里正确取出文件（有两条不同的取数路径）、阻止浏览器「直接打开文件」的默认行为、读取目录结构、以及对类型和体积做安全校验。本篇专讲文件这条拖放支路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两条取文件的路径\">核心概念：两条取文件的路径</h2><p>拖入文件时，文件不在 <code>getData</code> 能取到的字符串里（那是给文本/HTML/URL 用的），而在 <code>dataTransfer</code> 的两个集合里：老的 <code>dataTransfer.files</code>（一个 <code>FileList</code>）和新的 <code>dataTransfer.items</code>（一个 <code>DataTransferItemList</code>）。前者简单直接，后者更强大——只有它能读目录、能区分「拖的是文件还是文本」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[drop 事件] --&gt; B[dataTransfer]&#10;  B --&gt; C[.files: FileList&lt;br/&gt;简单, 只有文件]&#10;  B --&gt; D[.items: DataTransferItemList&lt;br/&gt;强大, 文件+文本+目录]&#10;  C --&gt; E[遍历 File 对象]&#10;  D --&gt; F{item.kind}&#10;  F --&gt;|file| G[getAsFile / 目录入口]&#10;  F --&gt;|string| H[getAsString 文本]&#10;  E --&gt; I[校验类型与体积]&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[上传或预览]\">flowchart TD\n  A[drop 事件] --&gt; B[dataTransfer]\n  B --&gt; C[.files: FileList&lt;br/&gt;简单, 只有文件]\n  B --&gt; D[.items: DataTransferItemList&lt;br/&gt;强大, 文件+文本+目录]\n  C --&gt; E[遍历 File 对象]\n  D --&gt; F{item.kind}\n  F --&gt;|file| G[getAsFile / 目录入口]\n  F --&gt;|string| H[getAsString 文本]\n  E --&gt; I[校验类型与体积]\n  G --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[上传或预览]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>路径</th>\n<th>取法</th>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>dataTransfer.files</code></td>\n<td>直接遍历 <code>FileList</code></td>\n<td>取文件简单</td>\n<td>不能读目录、不能取文本项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>dataTransfer.items</code></td>\n<td>遍历 <code>DataTransferItemList</code></td>\n<td>文件/文本/目录全覆盖</td>\n<td>API 稍繁琐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>简单场景（只收文件、不要目录）用 <code>files</code>；要支持拖文件夹用 <code>items</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基础文件拖放-files-路径\">基础文件拖放：files 路径</h2><p>最常见的上传区只需 <code>files</code> 路径。要点是：在 <code>dragover</code> 里 <code>preventDefault</code> 把元素变成放置目标（理由见<a href=\"html5-drag-drop\">HTML5 拖放协议</a>），在 <code>drop</code> 里也 <code>preventDefault</code> 阻止浏览器默认打开文件，然后遍历 <code>dataTransfer.files</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const dropZone = document.getElementById(&#39;upload-zone&#39;);&#10;&#10;dropZone.addEventListener(&#39;dragover&#39;, (e) =&gt; {&#10;  e.preventDefault();&#10;  e.dataTransfer.dropEffect = &#39;copy&#39;; // 复制文件内容进页面，非移动磁盘文件&#10;  dropZone.classList.add(&#39;dragging&#39;);&#10;});&#10;&#10;dropZone.addEventListener(&#39;drop&#39;, (e) =&gt; {&#10;  e.preventDefault(); // 否则浏览器会导航去打开第一个文件&#10;  dropZone.classList.remove(&#39;dragging&#39;);&#10;  const files = [...e.dataTransfer.files];&#10;  files.forEach(handleFile);&#10;});&#10;&#10;function handleFile(file) {&#10;  console.log(file.name, file.type, file.size);&#10;  // 校验后上传，见下文&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dropZone</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getElementById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'upload-zone'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dropZone.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dragover'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  e.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">preventDefault</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  e.dataTransfer.dropEffect </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'copy'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 复制文件内容进页面，非移动磁盘文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dropZone.classList.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dragging'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dropZone.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'drop'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  e.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">preventDefault</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 否则浏览器会导航去打开第一个文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dropZone.classList.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">remove</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dragging'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> files</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">e.dataTransfer.files];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  files.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forEach</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(handleFile);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">file</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(file.name, file.type, file.size);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 校验后上传，见下文</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>dropEffect=&#39;copy&#39;</code> 在语义上很重要：你是把文件内容复制进页面，而非把用户磁盘上的文件「移走」，光标也会显示「+」复制反馈。<code>effectAllowed</code>/<code>dropEffect</code> 的协商规则在<a href=\"html5-drag-drop\">HTML5 拖放协议</a>讲过。</p>\n<h2 id=\"读取目录-items-文件系统入口\">读取目录：items + 文件系统入口</h2><p>要支持「把整个文件夹拖进来」，必须走 <code>items</code> 路径，并用 <code>webkitGetAsEntry()</code> 拿到文件系统入口（<code>FileSystemEntry</code>），再递归遍历。这个 API 历史上带 <code>webkit</code> 前缀，但已被各浏览器广泛实现。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"dropZone.addEventListener(&#39;drop&#39;, (e) =&gt; {&#10;  e.preventDefault();&#10;  for (const item of e.dataTransfer.items) {&#10;    if (item.kind === &#39;file&#39;) {&#10;      const entry = item.webkitGetAsEntry();&#10;      if (entry) traverseEntry(entry);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;});&#10;&#10;function traverseEntry(entry, path = &#39;&#39;) {&#10;  if (entry.isFile) {&#10;    entry.file((file) =&gt; handleFile(file, path + file.name));&#10;  } else if (entry.isDirectory) {&#10;    const reader = entry.createReader();&#10;    reader.readEntries((entries) =&gt; {&#10;      for (const child of entries) traverseEntry(child, path + entry.name + &#39;/&#39;);&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dropZone.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'drop'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  e.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">preventDefault</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e.dataTransfer.items) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (item.kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'file'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> entry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">webkitGetAsEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (entry) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">traverseEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(entry);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> traverseEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (entry.isFile) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    entry.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">file</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">file</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(file, path </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> file.name));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (entry.isDirectory) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> reader</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createReader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reader.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">readEntries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">entries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> child</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entries) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">traverseEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(child, path </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry.name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意一个易错点：必须在 <code>drop</code> 事件的同步阶段就调用 <code>webkitGetAsEntry()</code>，因为 <code>DataTransferItemList</code> 在事件回调结束后即失效——晚一拍（比如在 <code>await</code> 之后）再取就拿到 <code>null</code>。这是文件拖放的经典坑之一，更多坑见<a href=\"../practice/clipboard-dragdrop-pitfalls\">交互陷阱</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"安全校验-类型-体积-数量\">安全校验：类型、体积、数量</h2><p>文件来自用户，必须当不可信输入校验。三道关：<strong>类型</strong>（别只信 <code>file.type</code>，它来自扩展名/系统映射，可被伪造，敏感场景要读文件头 magic number 复核）、<strong>体积</strong>（前端先挡超大文件，避免无意义上传）、<strong>数量</strong>（限制一次拖入的文件数）。前端校验是体验优化，服务端必须再校验一遍——前端校验永远可被绕过。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const MAX_SIZE = 10 * 1024 * 1024; // 10 MB&#10;const ACCEPT = [&#39;image/png&#39;, &#39;image/jpeg&#39;, &#39;application/pdf&#39;];&#10;&#10;function validateFile(file) {&#10;  if (!ACCEPT.includes(file.type)) return { ok: false, reason: &#39;类型不支持&#39; };&#10;  if (file.size &gt; MAX_SIZE) return { ok: false, reason: &#39;文件过大&#39; };&#10;  return { ok: true };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MAX_SIZE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 10 MB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ACCEPT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'image/png'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'image/jpeg'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'application/pdf'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> validateFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">file</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ACCEPT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(file.type)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'类型不支持'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (file.size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MAX_SIZE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'文件过大'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>校验项</th>\n<th>前端手段</th>\n<th>为何不够</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类型</td>\n<td><code>file.type</code> / 读 magic number</td>\n<td><code>file.type</code> 可伪造，须服务端复核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体积</td>\n<td><code>file.size</code></td>\n<td>可绕过，服务端须限流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数量</td>\n<td>数组长度</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容安全</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>必须服务端扫描</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"接到上传-formdata-与进度\">接到上传：FormData 与进度</h2><p>校验通过后，文件走标准上传流程。拖放在这里和 <code>&lt;input type=&quot;file&quot;&gt;</code> 殊途同归——都得到 <code>File</code> 对象，之后用 <code>FormData</code> 提交、用 <code>fetch</code> 或 <code>XMLHttpRequest</code> 上传（要进度条时 <code>XMLHttpRequest</code> 的 <code>upload.onprogress</code> 仍是最稳的）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"async function upload(files) {&#10;  const fd = new FormData();&#10;  for (const f of files) {&#10;    if (validateFile(f).ok) fd.append(&#39;files&#39;, f, f.name);&#10;  }&#10;  const res = await fetch(&#39;/api/upload&#39;, { method: &#39;POST&#39;, body: fd });&#10;  return res.json();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> upload</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">files</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FormData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> files) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">validateFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(f).ok) fd.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'files'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, f, f.name);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> res</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/upload'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'POST'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, body: fd });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> res.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把拖放、点击选择（<code>&lt;input type=&quot;file&quot;&gt;</code>）、粘贴图片（来自<a href=\"../clipboard/paste-handling\">粘贴拦截与清洗</a>的 <code>clipboardData.files</code>）三条入口汇聚到同一个 <code>handleFile</code> / <code>upload</code>，是健壮上传组件的标准结构——三种方式拿到的都是 <code>File</code>，下游完全复用。上传作为表单提交的语义，归<a href=\"../../frontend-form-engineering/foundations/form-state-model\">表单工程</a>；本 hub 只负责「文件如何拖进来」这一段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>拖入的文件不在 <code>getData</code> 里，而在 <code>dataTransfer.files</code>（简单）或 <code>dataTransfer.items</code>（强大，能读目录、区分文件/文本）。</li>\n<li>文件拖放必须 <code>dragover</code> + <code>drop</code> 双 <code>preventDefault</code>（否则浏览器导航去打开文件），并设 <code>dropEffect=&#39;copy&#39;</code> 表达「复制内容进页面」。</li>\n<li>读目录走 <code>items</code> + <code>webkitGetAsEntry()</code> 递归，且必须在 <code>drop</code> 同步阶段取入口，否则列表失效拿到 <code>null</code>。</li>\n<li>文件是不可信输入：前端校验类型（别只信 <code>file.type</code>）、体积、数量，但服务端必须再校验一遍。</li>\n<li>拖放、点击选择、粘贴图片三条入口都产出 <code>File</code>，应汇聚到同一上传逻辑复用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章上一篇：<a href=\"html5-drag-drop\">HTML5 拖放协议</a> — 文件拖放所依赖的事件序列与 <code>preventDefault</code> 规则。</li>\n<li>剪贴板章：<a href=\"../clipboard/paste-handling\">粘贴拦截与清洗</a> — 粘贴图片这条与拖放共用 <code>File</code> 的入口。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../frontend-form-engineering/foundations/form-state-model\">表单状态模型</a> — 文件作为表单字段的状态与提交语义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"文件拖放与上传","id":"文件拖放与上传"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两条取文件的路径","id":"核心概念-两条取文件的路径"},{"level":2,"text":"基础文件拖放：files 路径","id":"基础文件拖放-files-路径"},{"level":2,"text":"读取目录：items + 文件系统入口","id":"读取目录-items-文件系统入口"},{"level":2,"text":"安全校验：类型、体积、数量","id":"安全校验-类型-体积-数量"},{"level":2,"text":"接到上传：FormData 与进度","id":"接到上传-formdata-与进度"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"HTML5 拖放协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-clipboard-dragdrop/dragdrop/html5-drag-drop"},"next":{"title":"自定义拖放交互","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-clipboard-dragdrop/dragdrop/custom-drag-interactions"}}